                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We need to be honest about what\u2019s going on here. I refuse to stand by idly in the midst of Republicans\u2019 disgraceful treatment of Sarah Bloom Raskin, Lisa Cook, Philip Jefferson and other smart, qualified women and people of color nominated by the Biden Administration.",
