                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Tonight I tested positive for COVID and am experiencing mild symptoms. I am following the CDC\u2019s guidelines, and I am incredibly grateful to be vaccinated and boosted. Looking forward to getting back to the Senate as soon as possible.",
