                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 27,
                "retweet_count": 20,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For 5 years I\u2019ve worked to save the pensions of 19,000 Minnesotans. If their pensions failed, their families faced poverty.\n\nI got to work, we passed the Butch Lewis Act, and today I watched @POTUS announce these families can sleep easier tonight knowing their pensions are safe. https://t.co/Q4zjhSLMCE",
