                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 15,
                "retweet_count": 19,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Native communities badly need more resources for culturally-appropriate mental health and substance use disorder prevention, treatment and recovery care.\n\u00a0\nI fought for Tribes and urban Indian health providers to be able to use resources in the way their communities need them.",
