                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Nobody in America should go hungry, and nutrition is at the top of my mind as we negotiate the Farm Bill.\n\u00a0\nI brought @Allison_OToole from @2Harvest to the State of the Union to uplift their incredible work and to see how the President is delivering for working families. https://t.co/Fx96Z3kvtD",
