                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Biden just named Minnesota\u2019s Allison O\u2019Toole to the President\u2019s Council on Sports, Fitness and Nutrition.\n\nAllison is a dogged champion for ending hunger in this country \u2013 the President picked a fierce advocate who sticks up for those in need. Congrats, @Allison_OToole! https://t.co/9AT9YmV3pw",
