                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Americans who use nutrition assistance programs should be able to access farmers markets \u2013 lack of technology shouldn\u2019t hinder them from getting healthy, nutritious produce straight from producers.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m leading this bill in the Senate.",
