                "retweet_count": 20,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Honored to join the Indian Health Board on Indigenous Peoples' Day for the ground blessing of their Menaandawiwe Wellness Campus.\n \nThis project will blend modern and traditional medicine, creating a place of healing and connection to nature for Native Americans. https://t.co/9dweZStTzE",
