                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "But wait, there's more!\n\nI introduced legislation to improve access to nutrition assistance at farmers' markets.\n\nThe bill simplifies the vendor process for small farmers and enables SNAP/EBT card use at markets, supporting local producers and preventing market monopolization.",
