                "text": "The best ideas come from those closest to the issues \u2014 that\u2019s why this bill expands Tribes\u2019 rights to administer nutrition assistance programs.\n\nIt\u2019s all about promoting Tribal sovereignty and helping Tribes fight hunger in a way that works best for them.\nhttps://t.co/6kpgcdagcR",
