                "text": "Farmers markets are great ways for smaller farms to sell their goods like the squash or apples you may have seen this fall.\n\nBut if a family relies on nutrition assistance, farmers markets aren\u2019t as accessible.\n\nFor Farm Bill Friday, I\u2019ll tell you what I plan to do about it. https://t.co/9Q4VP5dL4e",
