                "text": "Getting rid of Obamacare would be about the dumbest thing Congress could do.\n\nMinnesota expanded Medicaid to over 300,000 people under the ACA who can sleep easier at night knowing they have high quality health insurance when a family member gets hurt or a kid gets sick.",
