                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I understand the House is marking up a Farm Bill today.\n\nIt\u2019s inexcusable to propose a Farm Bill that would make a $30 billion cut to nutrition assistance. We know SNAP benefits are already woefully insufficient.\n\n$6 per day, per person, is not enough to support working families.",
